<topic id="roles_in_content_fusion">
    <title>User Roles</title>
    <shortdesc>User roles in <ph keyref="product"/> define platform access, administrative
    privileges, and permissions for projects and review tasks.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>User roles</indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
    <body>
    <p>Roles in <ph keyref="product"/> apply at different scopes. Some roles define
        <b>administrative privileges</b>, others determine the available <b>platform
        functionality</b>, and others control <b>access to specific resources or workflows</b>.</p>
    <p>When this guide refers to a <q>user role</q> without further qualification, it means a
      platform user role if the context is already clear. In other cases, the guide explicitly
      distinguishes between <ph product="fusion-cloud">organization roles, </ph>project roles<ph
        product="fusion-cloud">,</ph> and review task roles.</p>
